Title: M11 reopened near Stansted Airport after vehicle fire
Date: 2025-07-13
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [{'Speaker': 'National Highways spokesperson', 'Text': 'There is approximately 1.5 miles congestion following this incident so please allow time for these delays to clear.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 5, 'StartChar': 44, 'EndChar': 142}}], 'Description': [{'Description': 'Fire crews attended the scene and people faced delays of up to 60 minutes on approach, a National Highways spokesperson said.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 94}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'People stuck in the traffic can be seen leaving their vehicles and walking on the motorway. Hundreds of cars are stopped, some with their car doors open.'}]}
